Selenium Exceptions
=====================
1.org.openqa.selenium.InvalidArgumentException: invalid argument
When url address is wrong (without protocol-https)

2.NoSuchElementException: no such element: Unable to locate element:
When findElement() is not able to identify any webelement you will get this exception

3.StaleElementReferenceException: stale element reference: stale element not found
Whenever page get refresh and element is not loaded in DOM then such element is refer as stale element
so that case you will get staleElementReferenceException

4.InvalidSelectorException: Compound class names not permitted
When we identify webelement with multiple classname then this exception will throw by selenium


